sequenceDiagram
 actor Applicant
 actor Analyst
 actor Officer
 participant API
 participant PostgreSQL
 Applicant->>API: Submit revision with key
 API->>PostgreSQL: Lock application, check conditions, save snapshot
 PostgreSQL-->>API: Submission and receipt committed
 Analyst->>API: Claim and validate
 Analyst->>API: Assess current snapshot
 API->>PostgreSQL: Store factors, model version and score
 Analyst->>API: Submit justified recommendation
 Officer->>API: Decide with revision and new key
 API->>PostgreSQL: Verify current evidence and independent officer
 alt Approve
 API->>PostgreSQL: Commit decision, offer, event and receipt
 else Reject
 API->>PostgreSQL: Commit decision, event and receipt
 end
